  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "蓝白支架，投篮与套圈",
        "en": "Basketball and ring toss"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/LYB008V/80ee12c58653.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "蓝白色漂浮篮球架带篮球圈，两侧设置套圈挂钩。可以先投篮，再换套圈瞄准挂钩，两种游戏使用同一套漂浮支架。",
        "en": "The blue-and-white floating frame has a basketball hoop and ring-toss hooks on both sides. Switch between shooting baskets and aiming rings at the hooks on the same frame."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "球和套圈数量明确",
        "en": "Counted balls and rings"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/LYB008V/9c23a6b6c222.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "资料列有四个篮球、四种颜色共十二个套圈和一个手动打气筒。可以按颜色分组，也可以给每人分配同样数量的投掷配件，轮流进行游戏。",
        "en": "The listed accessories are four basketballs, twelve rings in four colors and one hand pump. Divide the pieces by color or give each player the same number for taking turns."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "泳池使用与收纳",
        "en": "Pool use and storage"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/LYB008V/5f053845f5b6.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "这款为二合一水上篮球与套圈组合，型号LYB008V，采用手提盒包装。游戏结束后把球、套圈和打气筒收齐，水上活动过程中需有人照看。",
        "en": "This 2-in-1 pool basketball and ring-toss version is model LYB008V, supplied in a carry box. Collect the balls, rings and pump after play. Pool activities require supervision."
      }
    }
  ],
